            "body": "> With respect to `query_updaters`, I think I was unclear. I did set it to include q. It didn't work.\n\nWhat does `:map q` show? It should contain only something like `<Cmd>lua MiniStarter.add_to_query(\"q\")<CR>`. If there is anything else, then it gets set somewhere else in the config.",
